  "details": "Description\n\nWhen using finger tracking all virtual keyboards type each letter twice. This started as soon as the new UI was released.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nUse finger tracking while using chat box or any other keyboard. It happens always and always types two letters for each key press.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-03_22-11-32.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_0f3adae5-d102-45b5-b7be-4d66f3bf70e2/1/file)",
